1
00:00:06,141 --> 00:00:08,792
It rains. The sound fills the room.

2
00:00:08,872 --> 00:00:10,875
And it seems to arrive at someone.

3
00:00:11,689 --> 00:00:14,992
Behind the eyes, or somewhere
just inside the head,

4
00:00:15,072 --> 00:00:16,735
there seems to be a point.

5
00:00:16,825 --> 00:00:18,905
From there the world is taken in.

6
00:00:18,985 --> 00:00:22,727
Every sight and every sound
appears to belong to it.

7
00:00:23,549 --> 00:00:25,819
Most of us never question this point.

8
00:00:25,899 --> 00:00:27,721
It does not feel like a belief.

9
00:00:27,801 --> 00:00:30,534
It feels like the most
obvious fact there is.

10
00:00:30,614 --> 00:00:33,876
Seeing is someone's seeing.
Thinking is someone's thinking.

11
00:00:33,956 --> 00:00:36,893
We give this centre many names: the self,

12
00:00:36,973 --> 00:00:39,270
the I, the one who knows.

13
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:42,586
Whatever the name, we
picture a quiet witness,

14
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:47,590
standing behind experience, looking out
through the senses at a world out there.

15
00:00:48,393 --> 00:00:50,065
So here is a simple question.

16
00:00:50,145 --> 00:00:52,760
When you look for the
witness, what do you find?

17
00:00:53,581 --> 00:00:58,202
Begin with a courtyard. A chariot
stands in it. Its wheels are still.

18
00:00:58,282 --> 00:01:00,158
A horse stamps at the gravel.

19
00:01:00,238 --> 00:01:04,755
Ask a passer-by what it is, and
they will say at once: a chariot.

20
00:01:05,561 --> 00:01:08,511
Now take it apart. Set the axle aside.

21
00:01:08,591 --> 00:01:11,731
Take away a wheel, the seat, the yoke.

22
00:01:11,811 --> 00:01:16,867
At each step, look for the chariot.
It is not the axle. It is not a wheel.

23
00:01:16,947 --> 00:01:18,687
And yet the word keeps working.

24
00:01:18,767 --> 00:01:20,834
You still know what to do with a chariot,

25
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:22,863
and what to do with a heap of wood.

26
00:01:23,698 --> 00:01:25,303
Then ask the last question.

27
00:01:25,383 --> 00:01:29,569
Is there a chariot in the arrangement,
over and above the arrangement?

28
00:01:29,649 --> 00:01:33,442
Look for it. You will not find a
further thing sitting in the wood,

29
00:01:33,522 --> 00:01:35,674
like a seed inside a fruit.

30
00:01:36,481 --> 00:01:40,545
Nothing has been denied. The chariot
still stands in the courtyard.

31
00:01:40,625 --> 00:01:42,094
The word still works.

32
00:01:42,174 --> 00:01:47,542
What has gone is an expectation: that a
chariot itself stood behind the parts,

33
00:01:47,622 --> 00:01:51,065
making them one thing. The
chariot never needed it.

34
00:01:51,869 --> 00:01:55,471
Now turn the same looking on
the witness. Look at a tree.

35
00:01:55,551 --> 00:02:00,131
There is the tree, bright in the
afternoon light, its leaves moving.

36
00:02:00,211 --> 00:02:03,107
There is the seeing of
it, vivid and clear.

37
00:02:03,187 --> 00:02:05,063
Now look for the one who sees.

38
00:02:05,143 --> 00:02:07,332
You find a tree, and a seeing.

39
00:02:07,412 --> 00:02:10,380
You do not find a viewer
standing apart from both.

40
00:02:11,193 --> 00:02:13,721
Try it with sound. The rain is heard.

41
00:02:13,801 --> 00:02:16,357
Look for the hearer,
apart from the hearing.

42
00:02:16,437 --> 00:02:19,360
What appears is the rain,
and the hearing of it.

43
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:23,205
The sense of someone listening
is itself something that appears:

44
00:02:23,285 --> 00:02:27,979
a thought, an impression, coming
and going. It is not the hearer.

45
00:02:28,802 --> 00:02:31,127
This does not mean that nobody sees.

46
00:02:31,207 --> 00:02:36,209
It does not mean a person has vanished.
The tree is seen. The rain is heard.

47
00:02:36,289 --> 00:02:39,814
You are listening now, and that
works well enough to act on.

48
00:02:40,625 --> 00:02:42,569
What the looking shows is narrower.

49
00:02:42,649 --> 00:02:47,243
The observer that seemed to stand behind
experience is not found as a separate

50
00:02:47,323 --> 00:02:50,871
thing. Seeing, hearing
and thinking are found.

51
00:02:50,951 --> 00:02:52,950
They are vivid, and they work.

52
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:56,405
The one who sees is not
found apart from the seeing.

53
00:02:57,213 --> 00:02:59,116
Many people feel a jolt here.

54
00:02:59,196 --> 00:03:02,106
The witness felt like
the floor of experience.

55
00:03:02,186 --> 00:03:05,194
Without it, there seems
to be nothing underneath.

56
00:03:06,028 --> 00:03:08,108
For now, notice only this.

57
00:03:08,188 --> 00:03:12,266
Each time the witness was looked
for, it had already been assumed.

58
00:03:12,346 --> 00:03:14,444
And nothing that appeared confirmed it.

